%%{init: {'theme':'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  actor Human
  participant Agent
  participant Skigard as skigard
  participant Harness as Harness
  Human->>Skigard: add owner/repo
  Skigard->>Skigard: fetch to quarantine, scan, score 1-10
  alt auto mode and score >= threshold
    Skigard->>Harness: approve, write skigard.lock, install
  else below threshold or hard stop
    Skigard-->>Human: warning with reasons, stays in quarantine
    Human->>Skigard: approve (types at /dev/tty) or add --force-install
    Skigard->>Harness: write skigard.lock, install
  end
  Agent->>Skigard: approve, --force-install, config set
  Skigard--xAgent: refused (needs a real terminal, no --yes)
  Harness-->>Agent: skill available
  Note over Human,Harness: verify recomputes hashes, fails on drift
